  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yabaseri Agricultural and Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ste International Yabaseri SARL (International Yabaseri) is a Beninese Limited Liability Company (SARL) founded in 2002 by Sero Razack Yarou Bao and his family. International Yabaseri specializes in agri-food processing particularly food flour from cereals such as corn, cassava and soybeans. The company also offers a variety of agri-food products such as fruit juices, vegetable milks, natural milks and cooking ingredients. International Yabaseri seeks to improve its production facilities and review its sourcing and production processes to ensure the quality of its products meet local food and safety requirements. USADF funds will be used to improve infrastructure and strengthen the organizations structure, increase production capacity for innovative products such as milk-based infant and adult flours, and support the marketing of the products.</narrative>
  </description>
